(* Beginning of Notebook Content *)
Notebook[{
Cell["Rewriting Systems and Causality", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"b1d54fca-f1a5-ab44-8437-b165945f1e45"],

Cell["\<\
WolframInstitute`Hypergraphs` \[LongDash] evolution, events and what depends \
on what\
\>", "Subtitle",ExpressionUUID->"43acc3c1-7a97-664f-af59-fe91aab310d2"],

Cell["\<\
A rewriting system is a set of rules together with a state to start from. \
Evolving it means applying every rule in every way it fits, to every state \
reached so far, for as many generations as asked. What comes out is a tree of \
state occurrences joined by events, and the causal graph is the record of \
which event depended on which. Everything below is live output from src/.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"91ef6065-a6de-c245-a2b9-d1c8a1830f6a"],

Cell["\<\
The design point this notebook is really about is in section 4. What \
\"depended on\" means is not fixed here: it is an option, because the answer \
is a fact about what the hypergraph is standing for rather than about the \
rewriting.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9d8dddc2-d49d-de4d-867d-466ed575612e"],

Cell["Loading the package", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"f366ebd0-6a48-6a4e-8dd6-2db5b4e945ef"],

Cell["\<\
The cell below is an initialization cell, which the front end evaluates when \
this notebook is opened. By the time you read this the package is already \
loaded.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"43940869-555d-3042-975e-9a82b76f5858"],

Cell["\<\
PacletDirectoryLoad[ParentDirectory[NotebookDirectory[]]];
Needs[\"WolframInstitute`Hypergraphs`\"]\
\>", "Input",
 InitializationCell->
  True,ExpressionUUID->"f865add7-2728-6448-9b00-8879f914cf68"],

Cell["1. A system is rules and a state to start from", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"1abe4100-c73a-074c-b2d7-7350c887a633"],

Cell["\<\
HypergraphRewritingSystem takes the rules and the initial state. The rules \
may be one HypergraphRule, a list of them, or plain arrows; the state may be \
anything Hypergraph accepts:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"548b5835-df86-ef45-9bf9-44dcc34ccaa1"],

Cell["\<\
subdivide = HypergraphRule[{{1, 2}}, {{1, 3}, {3, 2}}];
system = HypergraphRewritingSystem[subdivide, Hypergraph[{{1, 2}}]]\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"34884fae-d00c-114e-901d-4d2fd9786ea7"],

