Cell["\<\
An event says which rule fired, which state it acted on, which it made, and \
what it touched. \"Data\" is the event HypergraphRuleApply gave, so \
everything from the rewriting layer is still there:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5122d3b2-07f6-3942-a7f7-87f2e045cb91"],

Cell["KeyDrop[First @ system[\"EventList\", 1], {\"Rule\", \"Data\"}]", \
