Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Design note.  ",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "(a b) and (c d) are composed out of disjoint pairs of arrows, so by edges \
they are independent and the causal graph leaves them unrelated. By elements \
they are related, because both matches touch the object in the middle of the \
chain. For a category the second reading is arguably the honest one \
\[LongDash] the composites meet at that object and can be composed further \
through it \[LongDash] while for a system where the arrows are the only \
carriers of influence the first is. The rewriting does not decide; the option \
lets the model decide."
}], "Text",
 CellFrame->{{2, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellFrameMargins->{{10, 0}, {6, 6}},
 CellFrameColor->GrayLevel[0.7],
 FontColor->GrayLevel[
  0.25],ExpressionUUID->"7b170847-cb03-b341-9bf5-82df20994458"],

