Cell["Two rules at once", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"b802132f-0287-d44c-9709-bcde02427eed"],

Cell["\<\
A system may hold several rules, and each event records which of them fired:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e2c3c9c1-3bc8-bf4e-8ef9-84359261ea9c"],

Cell["\<\
unit = HypergraphRule[
  Hypergraph[{Vertex[1, p]}, {}],
  Hypergraph[{Vertex[1, p], Vertex[2, p]}, {Edge[{1, 2}, \"Directed\", \
Subscript[\"1\", p]]}]];
arrow = Hypergraph[{Vertex[1, r], Vertex[2, s]}, {Edge[{1, 2}, \"Directed\", \
f]}];
catSys = HypergraphRewritingSystem[{unit, comp}, arrow];
Tally[#[\"RuleIndex\"] & /@ catSys[\"EventList\", 2]]\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"b89551f4-0320-5743-b63f-96647a6e7506"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"1", ",", "8"}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"2", ",", "1"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]], "Output",ExpressionUUID->\
"63cf29f9-a9ec-0b47-a648-39d3f5a6bb79"],

Cell["\<\
Eight units and one composition: of the two arrows a unit can build, only the \
one at the target of f is composable with it. By edges, that composition \
depends on exactly one earlier event:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"14fb3af7-aef0-e147-bf58-b70cd9600c61"],

Cell["\<\
pairsOf @ catSys[\"CausalEdges\", 2, \"CausalDependence\" -> \"Edges\"]\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"0e4b7dee-0d3e-964e-a3be-78edb04b49f5"],

